= Job Application for HR Director

Dear Hiring Team,

I am delighted to apply in the HR Director position. With fifteen years of progressive experience across talent acquisition, compensation design and organizational development, I have led a team of nine HR business partners through two acquisitions with payroll and GOSI compliance ownership.

At TechCorp I redesigned the compensation framework for 400 employees and built the onboarding compliance training program. Previously at InnovateLLC I owned the performance review cycle and the onboarding program for 200 new hires.

My certifications include SHRM-SCP (2020) and PHR (2017). I hold a B.A. in Psychology from the University of California, Berkeley. My skills span Employee Relations, Compensation Design, Talent Acquisition, HRIS, Workday, SAP SuccessFactors and payroll administration.

Thank you for your consideration. I look forward to discussing how my experience aligns with your team's needs.

Sincerely,

John Smith
